    "Name": "Chalchiuhtotolin CL",
    "Details": "The Chalchiuhtotolin is a vehicle produced by Clan Jade Falcon during the post-Jihad era in response to the need for an urban combat vehicle. The vehicle's strange name can be attributed to Clan Merchant Factor Daniel. The tank is powered by a 230-rated Fusion Engine, which is capable of propelling the vehicle up to 86 km/h. The tank's weaponry was designed to be as accurate as possible as a means of minimizing damage to property and civilians when performing its urban enforcement duties. \n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 5/8 hexes / 150/240 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Ferro-Fibrous (C)\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       215     25\n<b>Left</b>         150     25\n<b>Right</b>       150     25\n<b>Rear</b>        100     25\n<b>Turret</b>      125     25\n\n<b>Total</b>      740    125</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Off Roader</color>",
    "Icon": "Chevalier"
  },
